```{=html}
<div class="smt-grid smt-posts">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <div class="smt-card smt-post" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
    <% if (item.image) { %>
    <img class="smt-post-img" src="<%- item.image %>" alt="" loading="lazy">
    <% } else { %>
    <div class="smt-post-img smt-post-img-empty"></div>
    <% } %>
    <div class="smt-post-body">
      <span class="smt-muted smt-small"><%= item.date %></span>
      <a class="smt-card-title stretched-link" href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a>
      <% if (item.description) { %>
      <span class="smt-muted smt-small"><%= item.description %></span>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
